  "headline": "Arsenal’s flying start comes with a warning",
  "summary": "The Premier League says Arsenal’s 27 points from 10 matches equal their best start, but history offers a caution: the only previous teams with that total at this stage finished second. Their five-point lead remains significant, with only nine champions in 34 seasons having recovered from a gap of five points or more after 10 matches.",
